From 9f0eb6b066bb780e9e108a90b78d6668bfdd64a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 13:34:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] fix(build): generate Isar code with a compatible SDK
 instead of pinning analyzer

isar_community_generator 3.3.2 only supports analyzer <11, which cannot
process Dart 3.13 (Flutter 3.47). Every CI run since the Isar Community
migration failed at code generation.

- New composite action .github/actions/isar-codegen generates the models
  with Flutter 3.41.4; the rest of each job keeps FLUTTER_VERSION.
- Used by ci, build_apk, release_android and release_ios.
- Pin isar_community, generator and flutter_libs to exactly 3.3.2.
- build_runner ^2.15.1, no analyzer/dart_style pins, no overrides.
- Replace deprecated 'flutter pub run'.
- docs/ISAR_TOOLCHAIN.md documents evidence, sources and exit criteria.
